  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Let  <math><mi>M</mi><mo>∝</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> <br/><br/>        Writing dimensions on both sides and using the principle of homogeneity of dimensions we have, <br/><br/>         <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>M</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>L</mi><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow></msup></math> <br/><br/>        On comparing the power on both sides we get  <math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>  and  <math><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> <br/><br/>        On solving we have  <math><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>  <br/><br/>          <math><mo>∴</mo></math>  units of mass is  <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>F</mi><mtext> </mtext><msup><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>",
